# Raw input: A serene gondola ride through Venice's narrow canals at golden hour. The gondolier, in a traditional striped shirt and straw hat, steers the polished wooden gondola past historic Gothic and Renaissance buildings with terracotta roofs. Arched bridges like Ponte di Rialto frame the scene, while the dome of San Giorgio Maggiore peeks from the distance. The water is calm, reflecting the warm golden light of the setting sun and the intricate facades of the buildings. The mood is tranquil yet lively, with soft sounds of water lapping against the gondola and distant laughter from other gondoliers. The lighting is soft golden hour, casting long shadows on the water and buildings while creating a warm, inviting glow. Colors are rich yet harmonious: golden sunlight on the water and buildings, terracotta roof tiles, deep blue sky with soft white clouds. The gondola's polished wooden hull is a rich, warm brown, contrasting softly with the lighter tones of the water and sky. Textures include the smooth, polished wood of the gondola hull; the weathered stone facades and terracotta roof tiles of historic buildings; and the rippling, reflective surface of the canal water. The artistic style is realistic yet romanticized—detailed rendering of architectural details, smooth water reflections, and warm lighting that enhances the timeless beauty of Venice. The style evokes classic European landscape paintings but with modern photographic realism. Quality tags: Ultra-high definition, photorealistic detail, sharp focus on architectural details and water reflections, warm color grading, cinematic composition.
